EN:
Are you ready for {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Halloween{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Do you have {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}candy{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} and the right
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}mask{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} for the occasion?

ES:
¿Estás list{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} para Halloween?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¿Tienes los dulces? ¿Sabes ya lo
que te vas a poner en la cocorota?

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Io ho un sacco di {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}dolcetti{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, quindi
sono prontissimo!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0021:}}Non ho paura
di niente e di nessuno!{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}AHAHAH!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bir dünya {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}şeker{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} hazırladım;
tamamım!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0021:}}Bundan sonra
korkacağım hiçbir şey yok!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}En Halloween no hay amor.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Todo el mundo te quiere
solo por tus dulces!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Are you trying to tell me there are{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
people out there scared by those
freaky monster guys?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}C'mon! I have a scarier look than
they do! {{TAG:0003:0007:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}GRAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}See? Now who's
the scary monster? {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}¿Te puedes crees que hay gente
a la que le asustan esos monstruos
grandes de las cicatrices?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Pero si yo doy más miedo que eso!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Mira, mira:{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0007:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}¡BUUU!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}¿Lo ves?{{TAG:0007:0000:0C000000}}
¡No necesito ni máscara!{{TAG:0007:0000:0C000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Şu acayip canavarlardan
gerçekten korkanlar mı var
diyorsun?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hadi canım! Ben
onlardan daha korkuncum! {{TAG:0003:0007:}}{{TAG:0007:000A:}}GRAH!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}
Gördün mü? Asıl canavar kimmiş? {{TAG:0003:0002:}}
GAHAHA!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}You think I'm scared of big bugs?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Knock it off with the bad jokes!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Is there a man in the world who
really hates bugs?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:002C:}}The bigger the bug,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} the more
impressive it is!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Yo digo que los bichos
no dan miedo.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}¿O tú crees que habrá inocentones
por el mundo que se asusten
de una cosa tan chica?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}¡Para mí,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} cuanto más grande sea
el bicho,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} {{TAG:0003:002C:}}más extraordinario!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}¡Ja, ja, ja!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}En tout cas, moi, c'est pas un
insecte géant qui va m'effrayer !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}La bonne blague...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Je suis un homme viril !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Les
bébêtes, ça me fait pas peur !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:002C:}}Au secours, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}pauvre de moi !{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Un
insecte !{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}HA HA HA !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Gli insetti? Fanno paura? A me???{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Sei proprio fuori strada, amic{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Gli insetti non sono piacevoli,
{{TAG:0003:002C:}}ma messi così in testa a qualcuno,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
sono più che innocui!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ben büyük böcekten korkacağım,
öyle mi?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}Saçma şaka yapma!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Böcekten gerçekten korkan adam
mı olur?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:002C:}}Böcek ne kadar büyükse{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
o kadar heybetlidir!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Cosa?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}I lupi mannari?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
Non mi fanno paura per niente!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Ma dai!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Una creatura che
si trasforma {{TAG:0003:0006:}}in lupo solo
perché guarda la luna piena...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Hai mai sentito una storia più
strampalata?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0028:}}Io no di certo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¿Una momia?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Pero si eso
