la mañana,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}cuando se quieran
cambiar para salir a la calle{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}¡Pues no tienen tarea,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} las pobres!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
Se merecen todo nuestro apoyo,{{TAG:0007:0000:0C000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}İskelet mi?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}O klişe
şeyler beni artık korkutmaz!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Bence iskeletler korkunçtan çok {{TAG:0003:0015:}}
kasvetli. Sence de öyle değil mi?

DE:
